---
// Hero.astro - Híbrido editorial: claridad + identidad paraguaya
---

<header class="relative min-h-screen overflow-hidden px-6 pt-20 md:px-12">
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0">
        <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-[1px] w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-neutral-800 to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="absolute -right-10 top-24 hidden rotate-90 font-mono text-[11vh] font-black tracking-tight text-neutral-900/70 md:block">
            -25.1683 S / -57.4942 W
        </div>
        <div class="absolute left-6 top-24 hidden h-24 w-24 rounded-full border border-neutral-800/80 md:block"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto flex min-h-[80vh] w-full max-w-7xl items-center">
        <div class="w-full">
            <div class="mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-amber-500">Asuncion / PY</span>
                <span class="h-px w-12 bg-neutral-800"></span>
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500">Creative Technologist</span>
            </div>

            <h1 class="mb-10 text-6xl font-black leading-[0.85] tracking-tighter sm:text-7xl md:text-[8.5rem]">
                Mbarete
                <span class="mt-3 block font-mono text-[0.17em] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-500">
                    Code, Direction, Systems
                </span>
                <span class="block">Benja<span class="text-amber-500">.</span></span>
            </h1>

            <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-end">
                <p class="max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-300 md:text-lg">
                    Construyo productos digitales con pulso editorial para <span class="italic text-white">Nellyx</span>,
                    desde infraestructura hasta dirección visual, y una forma de trabajar bien paraguaya:
                    criterio, detalle y terere.
                </p>

                <a
                    href="#proyectos"
                    class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 self-start rounded-full border border-neutral-800 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-neutral-200 transition hover:border-amber-500 hover:text-amber-400"
                >
                    Ver rembiapo
                    <span class="rounded-full border border-neutral-800 p-2 transition group-hover:border-amber-500 group-hover:bg-amber-500 group-hover:text-black">
                        <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 border-t border-neutral-800 pt-6 md:grid-cols-3">
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-800/70 bg-neutral-900/30 px-4 py-3">
                    <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-500">Principio</p>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-300">Menos ruido, mas direccion.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-800/70 bg-neutral-900/30 px-4 py-3">
                    <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-500">Metodo</p>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-300">Idea clara, ejecucion limpia, entrega real.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-800/70 bg-neutral-900/30 px-4 py-3">
                    <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-500">Identidad</p>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-300">Tecnologia global con acento de Asuncion.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>
